      "tadyathāpi nāma śāriputra ahametarhi teṣāṃ buddhānāṃ bhagavatāmevamacintyaguṇān parikīrtayāmi, evameva śāriputra mamāpi te buddhā bhagavanta evamacintyaguṇān parikīrtayanti | suduṣkaraṃ bhagavatāṃ śākyamuninā śākyādhirājena kṛtam | sahāyāṃ lokadhātāvanuttarāṃ samyaksaṃbodhimabhisaṃbudhya sarvalokavipratyayanīyo dharmo deśitaḥ kalpakaṣāye sattvakaṣāye dṛṣṭikaṣāya āyuṣkaṣāye kleśakaṣāye || Sukhs_18 ||"
